yā.", "Sabbepi dehino hontu, vimuttirasabhāgino.", "Ciraṁ tiṭṭhatu lokasmiṁ, Sammāsambuddhasāsanaṁ.", "Tasmiṁ sagāravā niccaṁ, hontu sabbepi pāṇino.", "Sammā vassatu kālena, devopi jagatīpati.", "Saddhammanirato lokaṁ, dhammeneva pasāsatū”ti.", "Badaratitthavihāravāsinā Ācariyadhammapālattherena katā", "Therīgāthānaṁ atthasaṁvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."], "app": []}, {"label": null, "lines": ["Therīgāthā-aṭṭhakathā niṭṭhitā."], "app": []}]}